{"id":"n58166-1-9","stage":0,"title":"움직이다 · 动","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58166-1-9-1","ko":"아이가 방금 손가락을 움직였어요.","zh":"孩子刚才动了动手指哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손가락을","meaning":"手指","explanation":"손가락：手指；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손가락","audio":"/audio/72b09f1f28b0fd5244a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55504","senseId":"1","lemma":"손가락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"움직였어요.","meaning":"动，移动，动弹","explanation":"움직이다：动，移动，动弹；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"움직이다","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58166","senseId":"1","lemma":"움직이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"72b09f1f28b0fd52","term":"손가락","zh":"手指","audio":"/audio/72b09f1f28b0fd5244a2.mp3","entryId":"55504","definition":"手掌的五个终端部分。","pronunciation":["손까락"]},{"id":"05377c221a1ec676","term":"움직이다","zh":"动，移动，动弹","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3","entryId":"58166","definition":"变换位置或姿势；或指使位置或姿势发生变化。","pronunciation":["움지기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f0ddb51a8efa7f25fe7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58166-1-9-2","ko":"이제 깨어났나 봐요.","zh":"看来他现在醒过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깨어났나","meaning":"醒来","explanation":"깨어나다：醒来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"깨어나다","audio":"/audio/10f0191fb171df1e28a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32566","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"10f0191fb171df1e","term":"깨어나다","zh":"醒来","audio":"/audio/10f0191fb171df1e28a0.mp3","entryId":"32566","definition":"摆脱睡梦或醉酒的状态，恢复清醒的头脑。","pronunciation":["깨어나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f33604319ce834515c17.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.517,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58166","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.0691,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["孩子刚才动了动手指哦。","看来他现在醒过来了。","你认不出我了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["孩子刚才动了动手指哦。","看来他现在醒过来了。","你认不出我了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
